        "nobel_worthiness": "Superconducting nanowire single-photon detectors supplied a major enabling detector technology for quantum optics and photon-starved measurements.",
        "attribution": "Gol'tsman led the original detector breakthrough, with Sobolewski and Nam important in its physical and technological development.",
        "maturity": "High-efficiency nanowire detectors are mature experimental instruments used internationally.",
        "uncertainties": [
